("pregnant-1x7sc1p",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["social_media","horror_stories","fear_source"],"Of course, my phone knows I'm pregnant, so my feeds are absolutely flooded with pregnancy, birth, and baby-related content.","28 weeks, relaxed and happy until she opens social media.",None),
("pregnant-1x7sc1p",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["social_media","horror_stories","birth_fear"],"Pregnancy complications, terrifying birth stories, unbearable labor pain, permanent changes to women's bodies, relationships falling apart, dads not pulling their weight, constant exhaustion, sleepless nights... and the list goes on and on.","What her feeds show her.",None),
("pregnant-1x7sc1p",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","belief",["social_media","fear_source","positive_stories"],"Im excited to become a mom, but scrolling through social media makes me feel like I'm supposed to be terrified of everything that's coming instead.","Same post; asks for positive experiences.",None),
